     HTML error page.
  3. Probe for a newer vintage separately (dph2026.xsd, dphv26.xsd — both 404
     as of 2026-08-19, so the open-ended 2025 version record is correct).
  4. If a digest moved: replace the file, update this line, re-run the export
     tests, and check whether the vzor's period range changed too — with no
     Ucinnost in the file, the version record's valid_from/valid_to is
